# Title: Trusty Rules Content Pack (Part 1)
# Lang: [en-US]

## Section: Spelling - CVC (Doubling)
- stop + ing | stopping, stoping
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- run + er | runner, runer
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- big + er | bigger, biger
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- swim + ing | swimming, swiming
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- hot + est | hottest, hotest
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- plan + ed | planned, planed
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- sit + ing | sitting, siting
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- thin + er | thinner, thiner
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- win + er | winner, winer
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]
- skip + ed | skipped, skiped
  [rule: Spelling_CVC]

## Section: Spelling - Silent E
- make + ing | making, makeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- write + ing | writing, writeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- bake + er | baker, bakeer
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- dance + ing | dancing, danceing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- use + ed | used, useed
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- smile + ing | smiling, smileing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- close + ing | closing, closeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- ride + ing | riding, rideing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- hope + ing | hoping, hoppeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]
- take + ing | taking, takeing
  [rule: Spelling_Silent_E]

## Section: Spelling - Y to I
- study + ed | studied, studyed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- copy + ed | copied, copyed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- cry + es | cries, crys
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- happy + ly | happily, happyly
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- dry + ed | dried, dryed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- city + es | cities, citys
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- baby + es | babies, babys
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- fly + es | flies, flys
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- marry + ed | married, marryed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]
- try + ed | tried, tryed
  [rule: Spelling_Y_to_I]

## Section: Plural Irregular
- mouse + s | mice, mouses
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- tooth + s | teeth, tooths
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- child + s | children, childs
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- foot + s | feet, foots
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- man + s | men, mans
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- woman + s | women, womans
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- goose + s | geese, gooses
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- person + s | people, persons
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- fish (plural) | fish, fishes
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]
- ox + s | oxen, oxes
  [rule: Plural_Irregular]

## Section: Irregular Verbs (3 forms)
- drink (3 forms) | drink-drank-drunk, drink-drunk-drank
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- go (3 forms) | go-went-gone, go-gone-went
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- see (3 forms) | see-saw-seen, see-saw-saw
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- take (3 forms) | take-took-taken, take-taken-took
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- write (3 forms) | write-wrote-written, write-written-wrote
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- sing (3 forms) | sing-sang-sung, sing-sung-sang
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- eat (3 forms) | eat-ate-eaten, eat-eaten-ate
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- speak (3 forms) | speak-spoke-spoken, speak-spoken-spoke
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- do (3 forms) | do-did-done, do-done-did
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]
- begin (3 forms) | begin-began-begun, begin-begun-began
  [rule: Verb_Irregular_All]

## Section: Verb - 3rd Person Singular
- he + catch | catches, catchs
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- she + fly | flies, flys
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- it + watch | watches, watchs
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- he + say | says, saies
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- she + go | goes, gos
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- it + finish | finishes, finishs
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- he + play | plays, plaies
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- she + kiss | kisses, kisss
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- it + fix | fixes, fixs
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]
- he + buy | buys, buies
  [rule: Verb_3rd_Person]

## Section: Prepositions of Time
- У жовтні | in October, on October
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- У понеділок | on Monday, in Monday
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- О 7 годині | at 7 o'clock, on 7 o'clock
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- Вихідними | at the weekend, in the weekend
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- Вранці | in the morning, at the morning
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- Вночі | at night, in night
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- Влітку | in summer, on summer
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- Опівдні | at noon, in noon
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- 25 грудня | on December 25th, in December 25th
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- У 2024 році | in 2024, at 2024
  [rule: Prep_Time]
- до 11 вечора (не пізніше ніж) | by 11 pm, until 11 pm
  [rule: Prep_Time]

## Section: Prepositions of Place
- На стіні | on the wall, in the wall
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- У черзі | in a queue, on a queue
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- На зупинці | at the bus stop, on the bus stop
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- В небі | in the sky, on the sky
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- На роботі | at work, in work
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- У ліжку | in bed, at bed
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- На кутку (вулиці) | on the corner, in the corner
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- В аеропорту | at the airport, in the airport
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- На телебаченні | on TV, in TV
  [rule: Prep_Place]
- У книжці | in the book, on the book
  [rule: Prep_Place]

## Section: Articles - A vs An
- яблуко | an apple, a apple
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- година | an hour, a hour
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- університет | a university, an university
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- ідея | an idea, a idea
