- старий дім | an old house, a old house
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- парасоля | an umbrella, a umbrella
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- чесна людина | an honest man, a honest man
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- одиниця | a unit, an unit
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- апельсин | an orange, a orange
  [rule: Article_A_An]
- яйце | an egg, a egg
  [rule: Article_A_An]

## Section: Vocabulary - Fixed Collocations
- робити помилку | make a mistake, do a mistake
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- займатися спортом | do sports, make sports
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- приймати душ | take a shower, do a shower
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
