- прийняти рішення | make a decision, do a decision
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- піти на прогулянку | go for a walk, go to a walk
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- дивитися телевізор | watch TV, look TV
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- слухати музику | listen to music, listen music
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- пити каву | have coffee, do coffee
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- залежати від | depend on, depend from
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- платити карткою | pay by card, pay with card
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]
- платити готівкою | pay in cash, pay by cash
  [rule: Collocation_Fixed]

